    "fatGrams": 43
  },
  "ingredients": [
    "24 ounce bone-in pork chops",
    "2 tablespoon butter",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "24 ounce cauliflower",
    "3 ounce bacon (chopped)",
    "4 ounce cream cheese",
    "1/2 cup heavy cream",
    "2 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "3 medium green onion (chopped)",
    "1 cup cheddar cheese (shredded)",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather and prep all ingredients. Preheat oven to 400F. Break the cauliflower into florets (and chop stems small).",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pork-chops-with-loaded-cauliflower/#wprm-recipe-54777-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Keto-Pork-Chops-with-Loaded-Cauliflower-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a pot of lightly salted water to a boil and add cauliflower. Boil for about 6-8 minutes to par-cook it, then drain and set aside. You want it slightly tender but not hard.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pork-chops-with-loaded-cauliflower/#wprm-recipe-54777-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Keto-Pork-Chops-with-Loaded-Cauliflower-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a pan over medium heat, fry the chopped bacon until crisp. Reserve any fat and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pork-chops-with-loaded-cauliflower/#wprm-recipe-54777-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Keto-Pork-Chops-with-Loaded-Cauliflower-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine all of the ingredients for the loaded cauliflower - add par-cooked cauliflower, bacon (and reserved fat), cream cheese, heavy cream, garlic, green onion, and salt and pepper to taste. Add 1/2 to 3/4 of the cheddar cheese, reserving some to use as the topping.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pork-chops-with-loaded-cauliflower/#wprm-recipe-54777-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Keto-Pork-Chops-with-Loaded-Cauliflower-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread the cauliflower mixture into a casserole dish, then sprinkle the remaining cheddar cheese over the top. Place into the oven and bake for 25-30 minutes or until cauliflower is completely tender and cheese is bubbling on top.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pork-chops-with-loaded-cauliflower/#wprm-recipe-54777-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Keto-Pork-Chops-with-Loaded-Cauliflower-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the loaded cauliflower is cooking, work on cooking the pork chops. Season pork chops with salt and pepper to taste. Heat butter in a pan over medium heat. Once hot, add in the pork chops and fry until both sides are browned and the pork is cooked through. About 3-4 minutes per side depending on thickness.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pork-chops-with-loaded-cauliflower/#wprm-recipe-54777-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Keto-Pork-Chops-with-Loaded-Cauliflower-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve pork chops with loaded cauliflower and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pork-chops-with-loaded-cauliflower/#wprm-recipe-54777-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
